koz Benchmark : closures. 900 closures are created, each one reads and writes a variable of its parent finkoz

zafer compteur(n)
ouver
    keksoz total idon 0
    zafer ajoute(k)
    ouver
        total idon total èk k
        ran total
    fèrm
    ran ajoute(n) èk ajoute(1)
fèrm

zafer repete(k)
ouver
    kan k piti 1 ouver ran 0 fèrm
    compteur(k)
    ran repete(k mwin 1)
fèrm

afise(repete(900))
afise(compteur(5))
